                                                "sense_id": "fbe31e7d-17e8-3aef-b25d-87166e033716",
                                                "text": "Outside my retreat, our house was full of relatives and other people. […] Mukundalal the durwan is outside rolling on the ground with the one-eyed wrestler, trying out a new wrestling fall."
                                            }
